  "description": "A PDF library for .NET built from the ISO 32000 specification with no dependencies: create PDFs with text, graphics, fonts and images; convert HTML, images and scans to PDF; lay out flowing documents with tables; read, merge, split, encrypt and fill forms; extract text; produce PDF/A-2b.",
