  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Internal support for the new SoftZenPdf.Ocr, SoftZenPdf.Redact and SoftZenPdf.Optimizer add-ons: an embedded font for invisible text, a content-stream interpreter and editor, a JPEG decoder and encoder, and rewriting existing files with object streams, linearization and encryption kept. No public API changes. Full notes: https://pdf.softzensystems.com/changelog",
